{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultSize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"width","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf","text":"Float","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"height","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Float","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"width","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default width for windows created from a scene."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"height","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default height for windows created from a scene."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that uses a default size for new windows."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this scene modifier to indicate a default initial size for a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"window that the system creates from a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" declaration. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, you can request that new windows that a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generates occupy 600 points in the x-dimension and 400 points in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the y-dimension:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultSize(width: 600, height: 400)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The size that you specify acts only as a default for when the window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first appears. People can later resize the window using interface"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"controls that the system provides. Also, during state restoration,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system restores windows to their most recent size rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the default size."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you specify a default size that’s outside the range of the window’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inherent resizability in one or both dimensions, the system clamps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"affected dimension to keep it in range. You can configure the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resizability of a scene using the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene\/windowResizability(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modifier."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The default size modifier affects any scene type that creates windows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in macOS, namely:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Window"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentGroup"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Settings"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to specify the size input in terms of size instance,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Scene\/defaultSize(_:)-5y8n"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never\/defaultSize(_:_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/swift\/never\/defaultsize(_:_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE11defaultSizeyQrSf_SftF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s5NeverO","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"title":"defaultSize(_:_:)","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultSize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Float"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Float"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene"}]},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/